WEBVTT

00:00:28.144 --> 00:00:31.473
Insoniyatning kelajagi qanday?

00:00:31.473 --> 00:00:34.016
1920-yillarga qadar

00:00:34.016 --> 00:00:37.006
hamma koinotni
vaqt oralig'ida turg'un

00:00:37.006 --> 00:00:40.046
va o'zgarmas deb o'ylagan.

00:00:40.046 --> 00:00:44.675
So'ng koinot kengayib borayotganligi,

00:00:44.675 --> 00:00:49.500
olis galaktikalar bizdan 
uzoqlashayotgani aniqlandi.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:54.263
Bu ular o'tmishda bir-biriga yaqinroq 
joylashganidan darak beradi.

00:00:54.263 --> 00:00:56.376
Mavjud xulosalardan
tahmin qiladigan bo'lsak,

00:00:56.376 --> 00:01:00.020
taxminan 15 milliard yil avval 
barcha galaktikalar